# mod-custom-spells: the Hunter custom class spells (the /spells picker) on a
# bot. Every check states the CONCEPT's behaviour (share-public
# custom-spells/08-rework-20261008.md, concept source "Paragon Passive
# Spells"), so a FAIL marks a defect, not a typo.
# Test ground: map 13, the FL dummy arena - eight AoE Training Dummies
# (920018: take 0 damage, never die, the combat log still reads the full
# amount) on a 4-yd circle around (-270, 150). The hunter shoots from 15 yd
# west of the west-most dummy d1 (-288.9, 150), facing the ring.
# Gear: the slot-4 dwarf hunter's own Old Blunderbuss (2508) and Small Ammo
# Pouch; Light Shot 2516 is its ammo (PLAYER_AMMO_ID - a bot cannot set it, so
# the stack must never run dry: the cleanup leaves 1000). `.additem 2516 <n>`
# only works when <n> is no item id: the parser takes 2516 as a character GUID
# first (2516 200 -> "Player not found!").
# Pet: a Snow Tracker Wolf (1138; hunter pets swing every 2.0 sec) made by
# `tame`. A bot's new pet is passive (react state 0, no client to change it):
# the hunter_marksmanship rotation sets it defensive and sends it at d1, where
# it stays (a pet never leaves a living victim). Its swings log as spell 0.
# 900504 runs on the ring: safe only because the rework build's Beast Cleave
# trigger takes white hits only - the pre-rework OnDamage hook re-triggered on
# its own cleave damage (8 dummies x 15 % = 1.2 expected re-triggers per
# cleave, an unbounded recursion).
# Spells: Auto Shot 75, Multi-Shot 49048, Rapid Fire 3045 (+40 % ranged
# speed), Beast Cleave 900505, Explosive Burst 900567, Barrage Slow 900536,
# minion auras 901109 (+50 % damage done) / 901110 (+50 % melee haste).
name    Custom spells - Hunter
timeout 300s

bot hu hunter slot=4

place 13 -279 150 -423.2 0
require hu alive
pick d1 creature:920018 near hu
require d1 exists
do gm target hu
as gm .unlearn 900500
as gm .unlearn 900501
as gm .unlearn 900502
as gm .unlearn 900503
as gm .unlearn 900504
as gm .unlearn 900533
as gm .unlearn 900534
as gm .unlearn 900566
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
as gm .unaura 900534
as gm .unaura 900536
as gm .unaura 3045
do hu learn 75
do hu learn 49048
do hu destroy 2516
as gm .additem 2516 1000
expect hu item 2516 == 1000
do hu tame 1138
waitfor hu pet timeout 5s
do hu approach d1 15
wait 1s

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Shared
log Shared - control for 900500: without it every Auto Shot uses up an arrow
do hu cast 75 on d1
wait 7s
do hu stop
wait 500ms
expect hu item 2516 < 1000

log Shared - 900500 Get Back Arrows: every shot gives its arrow back (7 s of Auto Shot, the count stays 1000)
do hu learn 900500
do hu destroy 2516
as gm .additem 2516 1000
do hu cast 75 on d1
wait 7s
do hu stop
wait 500ms
expect hu item 2516 == 1000

log Shared - 900500 a Multi-Shot takes one arrow per target (3 here): all of them come back
do hu destroy 2516
as gm .additem 2516 1000
do hu cast 49048 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
expect hu item 2516 == 1000
as gm .unlearn 900500

log Shared - 900501 Multi-Shot hits every enemy within 10 yd of its target, each one once
do hu learn 900501
spelllog start
do hu cast 49048 on d1 triggered
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 49048 maxtargets >= 6
expect hu spell 49048 maxtargets >= 7
expect hu spell 49048 hits <= 8
as gm .unlearn 900501

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Marksmanship
log MM - 900533 Auto Shot also hits up to 9 other enemies within 10 yd of its target
do hu learn 900533
spelllog start
do hu cast 75 on d1
wait 5s
do hu stop
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 75 targets >= 6
as gm .unlearn 900533

log MM - 900534 Barrage: Multi-Shot every 0.1 sec at the target for 2 sec (20 shots)
do hu learn 900534
do hu target d1
spelllog start
do hu cast 900534
wait 500ms
expect hu aura 900534
expect hu auramaxduration 900534 <= 2000
wait 2s
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 49048 casts >= 15
expect hu noaura 900534

log MM - 900534 control for the slow: without Barrage the hunter runs 10 yd west in 2 sec
do hu goto -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do hu walk -298.9 150 -423.2
wait 2s
expect hu near -298.9 150 -423.2 1.5
do hu goto -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 500ms

log MM - 900534 Barrage slows the hunter by 50 % while it lasts: after 1.5 sec of the same run only half way (-293.9)
do hu cast 900534 triggered
do hu walk -298.9 150 -423.2
wait 1500ms
expect hu aura 900534
expect hu aura 900536
expect hu near -293.9 150 -423.2 2.5
wait 1s
do hu stop
do hu goto -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do hu approach d1 15
wait 500ms
as gm .unlearn 900534

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Survival
log Survival - 900566 ranged damage: 15 % chance (2 sec cooldown) to set off an Explosive Burst (900567) around the target - statistical: 30 s of Auto Shot under Rapid Fire plus 3 Multi-Shots
do hu learn 900566
do hu cast 3045 triggered
spelllog start
do hu cast 75 on d1
do hu cast 49048 on d1
wait 10500ms
do hu cast 49048 on d1
wait 4500ms
do hu cast 3045 triggered
wait 6s
do hu cast 49048 on d1
wait 9s
do hu stop
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 900567 casts >= 1
expect hu spell 900567 targets >= 5
as gm .unlearn 900566
as gm .unaura 3045

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Beast Mastery
log BM - a bot's new pet is passive (no client sets it); the Marksmanship rotation makes it defensive and sends it at d1 (0.5 s - its auras and Hunter's Mark come off again)
do hu rotation hunter_marksmanship on d1 for 500ms
wait 1s
do hu stop
as gm .unaura 61847
as gm .unaura 19506
as gm .unaura 3045
do gm target d1
as gm .unaura 53338
do gm target hu
do hu goto -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do hu approach d1 15
wait 2s
pick pt creature:1138 near hu
expect pt victim d1

log BM - control for 900502/900503: 60 s of the pet's melee on d1 without them (2.0-sec swings: 30; about 66 a swing, 1850-2100 in all)
spelllog start
wait 60s
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 0 casts >= 27
expect hu spell 0 casts <= 33
expect hu spell 0 damage < 2450

log BM - 900502 Pet Damage +50 %: the pet's damage, as the combat log shows it, is half again as high (the same 60 s: about 2950; the line between at 2450 - statistical)
do hu learn 900502
wait 2s
expect pt aura 901109
spelllog start
wait 60s
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 0 damage >= 2450
as gm .unlearn 900502
waitfor pt noaura 901109 timeout 3s

log BM - 900503 Pet Speed +50 % (2.0 -> 1.33-sec swings: 28-32 in 40 s; without 20, at double speed 40) and 900504 Pet AoE Proc - 15 % of its white hits set off Beast Cleave 900505 on every other enemy within 10 yd of its target, never off its own cleave (statistical)
do hu learn 900503
do hu learn 900504
wait 3s
expect pt aura 901110
spelllog start
wait 40s
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 0 casts >= 27
expect hu spell 0 casts <= 33
expect hu spell 900505 casts >= 1
expect hu spell 900505 targets >= 5
expect hu spell 900505 casts <= 12
as gm .unlearn 900503
as gm .unlearn 900504
waitfor pt noaura 901110 timeout 3s

cleanup
do hu stop
do gm target hu
as gm .unaura 900534
as gm .unaura 900536
as gm .unaura 3045
as gm .unaura 61847
as gm .unaura 19506
do hu destroy 2516
as gm .additem 2516 1000
do gm target d1
as gm .unaura 53338
do gm target hu
as gm .unlearn 900500
as gm .unlearn 900501
as gm .unlearn 900502
as gm .unlearn 900503
as gm .unlearn 900504
as gm .unlearn 900533
as gm .unlearn 900534
as gm .unlearn 900566
as gm .unlearn 901101
as gm .unlearn 901102
as gm .unlearn 901103
as gm .unlearn 901104
as gm .unlearn 901111
